      {
        "finding": "Safety post-training on Minicpm-o-2.6 shows a diagonal effect: recovery peaks on the modality matching the training data and drops elsewhere. Image-text-trained models still exceed 20% C-ASR on image-audio-text inputs (Table 13).",
        "proposed_claim": "Safety alignment gains transfer poorly across input modalities not covered by the alignment data.",
